# Local photo-processing scratch work. None of this belongs in a PUBLIC repo:
# the scripts carry hardcoded machine paths (C:\Users\...\Pictures, D:\...),
# and images/ is ~9.2 GB of family photos across 652 files.
#
# The galleries this site once served were removed in favour of YouTube
# embeds, and the photo blobs have been purged from history. Do not let them
# back in.
